#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:2
msgid "HPE Bare Metal (BMaaS)"
msgstr "HPE Bare Metal (BMaaS)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:7
msgid ""
"HPE Bare-Metal-as-a-Service (BMaaS) for |morpheus| Enterprise extends hybrid"
" cloud management capabilities to HPE ProLiant physical servers. This "
"integration allows the |morpheus| platform to discover, provision, and "
"manage these servers as first-class resources. Additionally, HPE BMaaS Cloud"
" integrates HPE ProLiant bare-metal infrastructure into cloud environments "
"to enable cloud-based provisioning and lifecycle management."
msgstr ""
"HPE Bare-Metal-as-un-Service (BMaaS) para |morpheus| Enterprise extends "
"hybrid cloud management capabilities to HPE ProLiant physical servers. Esta "
"integración allows el |morpheus| platform to discover, provision, y manage "
"estos servers as primero-class recursos. Adicionalmente, HPE BMaaS Cloud "
"integrates HPE ProLiant bare-metal infrastructure en cloud entornos to "
"enable cloud-based provisioning y lifecycle management."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:9
msgid ""
"HPE BMaaS manages the end-to-end server lifecycle, including hardware "
"discovery, bare-metal provisioning, operating system deployment, monitoring,"
" and metering. The |morpheus| interface centrally orchestrates these tasks. "
"This unified approach enables organizations to manage physical "
"infrastructure, virtual machines, and cloud resources using consistent "
"workflows, policies, and governance controls."
msgstr ""
"HPE BMaaS manages el end-to-end server lifecycle, including hardware "
"discovery, bare-metal provisioning, operating sistema deployment, "
"monitoring, y metering. The |morpheus| interfaz centrally orchestrates estos"
" tasks. This unified approach enables organizations to manage physical "
"infrastructure, virtual machines, y cloud recursos using consistent "
"workflows, policies, y governance controls."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:12
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Características"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Automated Server Discovery** - Automatically imports and discovers HPE "
"ProLiant servers"
msgstr ""
"**Automated Server Discovery** - Automáticamente imports y discovers HPE "
"ProLiant servers"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Bare-Metal Provisioning** - Provisions hardware using custom or pre-"
"configured OS images"
msgstr ""
"**Bare-Metal Provisioning** - Provisions hardware using personalizado o pre-"
"configurado OS images"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Comprehensive OS Deployment** - Deploys Windows and Linux with unattended "
"installations and customizable boot parameters"
msgstr ""
"**Comprehensive OS Deployment** - Deploys Windows y Linux con unattended "
"installations y customizable boot parámetros"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Lifecycle Management** - Manages firmware and drivers using the HPE "
"Service Pack for ProLiant (SPP)"
msgstr ""
"**Lifecycle Management** - Manages firmware y drivers using el HPE Service "
"Pack para ProLiant (SPP)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Flexible Networking** - Supports both unmanaged and managed network "
"integrations"
msgstr ""
"**Flexible Networking** - Supports both unmanaged y managed network "
"integrations"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Metering and Billing** - Maps discovered hardware to service plans to "
"align metering with billing"
msgstr ""
"**Metering y Billing** - Maps discovered hardware to servicio plans to align"
" metering con billing"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Logical Organization** - Organizes resources into Bare Metal Clouds and "
"Resource Pools to support multi-site environments and scalable "
"infrastructure segmentation"
msgstr ""
"**Logical Organization** - Organizes recursos en Bare Metal Clouds y "
"Resource Pools to support multi-site entornos y scalable infrastructure "
"segmentation"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/hpe_bare_metal.rst:22
msgid ""
"HPE BMaaS improves operational visibility and server lifecycle control. It "
"offers a scalable, automated approach to manage physical infrastructure "
"across both greenfield (new) and brownfield (existing) environments."
msgstr ""
"HPE BMaaS improves operational visibility y server lifecycle control. It "
"offers un scalable, automated approach to manage physical infrastructure "
"across both greenfield (nuevo) y brownfield (existente) entornos."

