msgid "Firmware and Driver Lifecycle Management"
msgstr "Firmware y Driver Lifecycle Management"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/firmware_lifecycle.rst:4
msgid ""
"Starting with HPE BMaaS version 1.0.0,HPE |morpheus| Enterprise supports "
"firmware and driver updates for HPE ProLiant bare-metal servers using "
"preloaded tasks and workflows. This capability enables administrators to "
"centrally manage server firmware and driver compliance using HPE Service "
"Pack for ProLiant (SPP) images, executed directly from the HPE Morpheus "
"appliance."
msgstr ""
"Starting con HPE BMaaS versión 1.0.0,HPE |morpheus| Enterprise supports "
"firmware y driver updates para HPE ProLiant bare-metal servers using "
"preloaded tasks y workflows. This capability enables administrators to "
"centrally manage server firmware y driver compliance using HPE Service Pack "
"para ProLiant (SPP) images, executed directly desde el HPE Morpheus "
"appliance."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/firmware_lifecycle.rst:6
msgid ""
"Firmware and driver updates are performed through Jobs and Workflows in HPE "
"Morpheus and can be run in Dry Run (inventory)or Deploy modes. Updates can "
"target firmware only, drivers only, or both, depending on operational "
"requirements. The update process supports multiple servers per job and "
"provides detailed execution logs for auditing and troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"Firmware y driver updates son performed a través de Jobs y Workflows in HPE "
"Morpheus y puede be run in Dry Run (inventory)o Deploy modes. Updates puede "
"destino firmware solo, drivers solo, o both, dependiendo de operational "
"requirements. The update proceso supports múltiples servers per job y "
"provides detailed execution logs para auditing y troubleshooting."

