#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:97
msgid ""
"Once the network integration is created, networks can be created using the "
"specific network integration that was created. Networks essentially define "
"the VLAN that they represent along with other attributes such as the "
"subnet’s IPv4 prefix, IP address allocation method, gateway address, DNS, "
"etc. The screenshot below shows those details."
msgstr ""
"Once la red integration es creado, networks se puede crear using el "
"específico network integration que fue creado. Networks esencialmente define"
" el VLAN que they represent junto con otro atributos como el subnet’s IPv4 "
"prefix, IP dirección allocation método, gateway dirección, DNS, etc. The "
"screenshot a continuación shows esos detalles."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:99
msgid ""
"TheVLAN Trunksspecifies the trunk VLANs to be added when this network is "
"consumed by an instance. TheVLAN IDfield represents the primary VLAN for "
"this network. This VLAN is configured as the untagged VLAN when this network"
" is consumed by an instance."
msgstr ""
"TheVLAN Trunksspecifies el trunk VLANs to be agregado cuando esta red es "
"consumed by una instancia. TheVLAN IDfield represents el primario VLAN para "
"esta red. This VLAN es configurado as el untagged VLAN cuando esta red es "
"consumed by una instancia."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:101
msgid ""
"TheNetwork Servicecorresponds to the network integration that was created. "
"This specifies that the network is to be created in the infrastructure "
"(switches) specified in the network integration selected."
msgstr ""
"TheNetwork Servicecorresponds to la red integration que fue creado. This "
"specifies que la red es to be creado in el infrastructure (switches) "
"especificado in la red integration seleccionado."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:103
msgid ""
"ThePrivatecheckbox specifies that the network is a private network. By "
"default, all networks are public. If private is selected, the primary VLAN "
"in this network is not configured on the uplink connection. This would "
"render them unreachable from outside of the cloud infrastructure. This is "
"typically used for workload networks that are used to communicate between "
"only the workload servers and other infrastructure within the private cloud."
msgstr ""
"ThePrivatecasilla de verificación specifies que la red es un privado "
"network. By predeterminado, todos networks son público. If privado es "
"seleccionado, el primario VLAN in esta red no está configurado on el uplink "
"conexión. This sería render them unreachable desde outside of la nube "
"infrastructure. This es típicamente used para workload networks que se "
"utilizan para communicate entre solo el workload servers y otro "
"infrastructure dentro de el privado cloud."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:105
msgid ""
"The configuration of a network will result in the primary VLAN in that "
"network being provisioned on the network switches. The server ports are "
"configured when those networks are consumed during the provisioning of a "
"compute instance."
msgstr ""
"The configuración of una red será resultado in el primario VLAN in que "
"network being provisioned on la red switches. El servidor ports son "
"configurado cuando esos networks son consumed durante el provisioning of un "
"compute instance."

