#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:2
msgid "Storage Management"
msgstr "Storage Management"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:4
msgid ""
"There are two types of storage that are available for an instance to "
"consume. One is the local storage available on the compute server used to "
"create an instance. The other is the remote storage (SAN), using the Alletra"
" MP storage array."
msgstr ""
"There son two types of storage que son disponible para una instancia to "
"consume. One es el local storage disponible on el compute server used to "
"create una instancia. The otro es el remoto storage (SAN), using el Alletra "
"MP storage array."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:6
msgid ""
"At present, there is no support for the management of the local storage "
"throughHPE Morpheus. They are used to install the OS image, and any storage "
"available beyond that is up to the user to configure and use. They cannot be"
" managed fromHPE Morpheus."
msgstr ""
"At present, allí es no support para el management of el local storage "
"throughHPE Morpheus. They se utilizan para install el OS image, y cualquier "
"storage disponible beyond que es up to el usuario to configure y use. They "
"no puede be managed fromHPE Morpheus."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:8
msgid ""
"The remote storage is fully manageable. The user can create/update/delete "
"volumes and manage their attachment to compute servers."
msgstr ""
"The remoto storage es fully manageable. El usuario puede "
"create/update/delete volumes y manage their attachment to compute servers."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:11
msgid "Boot Volume Selection"
