#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:232
msgid ""
"During instance provisioning, the user can specify volumes to be attached to"
" the servers within the instance. There are various types of volumes user "
"can specify."
msgstr ""
"During instance provisioning, el usuario puede specify volumes to be "
"attached to el servidors dentro de la instancia. There son various types of "
